.obsidian/

# Screenshots and scratch images. Anything intended for the README goes in
# docs/, which stays tracked.
*.png
*.jpg
!docs/*.png
!docs/*.jpg

# Private planning notes. This folder doubles as an Obsidian note directory,
# so the sprint docs live alongside the plugin but are not part of it.
